      { "author": "Gabi Aviv", "authorUrl": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101492146349843194156/reviews?hl=zh-Hant-TW", "rating": 5, "relativeTimeAtCapture": "6 個月前", "text": "一個專業且設備齊全的忍者訓練中心，工作人員專業且熱情友善。強烈推薦。", "translated": true },
